      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -90,
        -390
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Compare Apify and n8n YouTube channel activity\nCompare two official YouTube channels using subscriber counts, recent upload activity and average views over the latest five sampled videos.\n\n[Preview the preset on Apify](https://apify.com/perceptive_city_af7/youtube-channel-email-scraper/examples/compare-apify-and-n8n-youtube-channel-activity)\n\n1. Open **Download YouTube channel activity** and select a **Header Auth** credential. Set its name to `Authorization` and its value to `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Click **Execute Workflow** once. This starts one Actor run on your Apify account, capped at **$0.03** and **2 rows**.\n3. Open the HTTP node’s **Output → Binary → data** and download the CSV. If the request times out, check [your Apify runs](https://console.apify.com/actors/runs) before starting a second run.",
        "width": 590,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5
